<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shobla Royale Hotel & Cottages</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <section class="outer">
        <img class="top-row" src="https://shoblaroyale.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/shobla-royale-hotels-and-cottages-logo.svg" alt="Shobla Royale Logo">
        <h1>Shobla Royale<br>Hotel &amp; Cottages</h1>
    </section>

    <section class="middle">
        <div class="gallery-img img1"></div>
        <div class="gallery-img img2"></div>
        <div class="gallery-img img3"></div>
        <div class="gallery-img img4"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="description">
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Soluta porro eaque illo ad corrupti dolorum dicta, ipsa aspernatur veniam! Voluptatum corrupti nemo ipsa suscipit, quam omnis deserunt quo? Voluptates debitis magnam aliquid consequatur sint, accusantium totam reiciendis doloremque voluptatum, dicta facilis architecto dolore.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sec-main">
        <div class="room-card">
            <img class="room-img" src="https://shoblaroyale.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/executive-room-hotel-shobla-royale-kullu.webp" alt="Executive Room at Shobla Royale">
            <div class="room-info">
                <h2>Executive Room</h2>
                <p class="room-description">A comfortable and elegant stay designed for guests who appreciate a peaceful atmosphere, thoughtful interiors, and a relaxing experience in Kullu.</p>
                <div class="room-details"><span>Comfortable Stay</span><span>Elegant Interiors</span><span>Ideal for Couples &amp; Families</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="room-card">
            <img class="room-img" src="https://shoblaroyale.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/luxury-room-hotel-shobla-royale-kullu.webp" alt="Luxury Room at Shobla Royale">
            <div class="room-info">
                <h2>Luxury Room</h2>
                <p class="room-description">Experience a refined stay with spacious interiors, a warm ambience, and modern comforts created for a memorable escape in the heart of Kullu.</p>
                <div class="room-details"><span>Premium Comfort</span><span>Spacious Interiors</span><span>Relaxing Ambience</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="thred-main">
        <div class="sec-room-card-one"></div>
        <div class="sec-room-card-two"></div>
        <div class="sec-room-card-three"></div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
